    "detailed_description": "Use cards to fight the incoming hordes of infernal enemies &amp; survive while building a different deck in each run.<br>Cards are your weapons, so choose wisely, combine them for maximum synergy and use them as you aim &amp; shoot.<br>Add and remove cards from your deck, combine them with relics and find synergies.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build your deck with over 100 different cards<br></li><li> Find over 50 relics that boost your cards and alter their effects<br></li><li> Fight over 12 different hellish enemies, coming at you in constant waves, and 3 bosses.<br></li><li> Unlock 3 characters, each with their own card management mechanic and unique cards<br></li><li> Survive 3 stages with different landscapes and challenges</li></ul>",
